# Local-only scratch the tooling writes into the repo. `.local.` is the
# convention for it; the ralph-loop plugin's iteration counter is one, and it
# had been committed and re-committed on every iteration.
.claude/*.local.md
.claude/*.local.json
reconstruct/libgame.so

# The original game. Not ours to redistribute; the tools read it locally.
lemming1.pc/
# The unpacked and decrypted game executable, the instruction records it is
# merged from, and its code map - built locally by tools/extract_image.py and
# tools/decrypt_image.py, never committed.
image/
